  "Chat: Why does login fail after sleep?": [
    [
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "commands",
        "names": ["/compact"]
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Read",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "src/login.ts"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Grep",
        "input": {
          "pattern": "retry",
          "path": "src"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "set_title",
        "args": {
          "title": "Login fails after sleep"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "plan",
        "steps": [
          { "text": "Read the login code", "status": "completed" },
          { "text": "Find why the retry is skipped", "status": "in_progress" },
          { "text": "Write the fix", "status": "pending" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "do": "background",
        "tasks": [
          { "description": "pnpm exec vitest run login.test.ts", "kind": "local_bash" },
          {
            "description": "Find where the token expires",
            "kind": "local_agent",
            "agent": "Explore"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "do": "say",
        "text": "## What I found\n\n- Login skips its retry after the Mac sleeps\n- The token has expired by then\n\n```ts\nconst retry = once;\n```\n\nSee [the retry notes](https://example.com/retry)."
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete"
      },
      {
        "do": "await_message",
        "contains": "File the work we agreed on"
      },
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "create_task",
        "args": {
          "title": "Retry login once on a 401",
          "acceptanceCriteria": ["Login retries once after a 401"],
          "areas": ["repo"]
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "start_task",
        "args": {
          "taskId": "$task:Retry login once on a 401"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "list_tasks",
        "args": {}
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "remove_task",
        "args": {
          "taskId": "$task:Hold the line"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "say",
        "text": "Filed it and started it. I left the other task alone."
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete"
      }
    ]
  ],
